onal efficiency and reduce your market exposure.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"1-4996752\",{\"className\":\"min-h-[365px] md:min-h-[250px] lg:min-h-[300px] bg-gradient-secondary rounded-[10px] md:rounded-[20px] xl:rounded-[15px] px-5 lg:px-6 xl:px-7 py-7 max-w-full lg:max-w-[487px] w-full flex flex-col\",\"role\":\"listitem\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-grow\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"cs-h3 text-white\",\"children\":\"Drive down operational risk\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"cs-text text-white\",\"children\":\"​The elimination of physical certificates, vault inspections and wet-ink signatures removes associated costs and capacity constraints. This significantly reduces operational and business resiliency risks.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"2-4996748\",{\"className\":\"min-h-[365px] md:min-h-[250px] lg:min-h-[300px] bg-gradient-secondary rounded-[10px] md:rounded-[20px] xl:rounded-[15px] px-5 lg:px-6 xl:px-7 py-7 max-w-full lg:max-w-[487px] w-full flex flex-col\",\"role\":\"listitem\",\"children\":[\"\",[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-grow\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-col gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"cs-h3 text-white\",\"children\":\"Future-proof your issuance strategy\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"cs-text text-white\",\"children\":\"Align with the evolution of securities law and meet environmental, social and governance (ESG) compliance goals with a “greener” issuance model.\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"36:[\"$\",\"$L2d\",\"6\",{\"fallback\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{}],\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"justify-center gap-6 grid  grid-cols-1\",\"role\":\"region\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"self-stretch flex flex-col justify-start items-start lg:gap-[31